"What is the payment schedule and is the price fixed?"},{"id":"fdpl-z455-faq-3","answer":"From order to handover of the keys the build takes 4-6 months, with on-site assembly of up to 14 days. The producer provides transport and assembly; the foundation slab is an extra cost outside the All-Inclusive package, and soil replacement is charged at actual cost.","question":"How long does the build take from order to handover of the keys?"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Prefabricated LGS steel frame (galvanised profiles) with mineral wool filling, cement-bonded particleboard, wind barrier and 150 mm facade insulation.', 'Roof pitch 30°, covering: sheet metal, metal tile or ceramic tile', 'The design can be adapted with the producer''s architects: changing the partition layout, the size and placement of windows and modifying the building form.', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
